  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/983cd9f3e84a0f8bef890c6968a7f0fffcb235d2.png\" alt=\"最佳化。清晰。精準。\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><em>以競技最佳化的材質包提升您的 PvP 體驗，增強戰鬥清晰度。</em></div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-CC_BY--NC--SA_4.0-blue.svg\" alt=\"授權條款\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/crystal-pvp-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"在 CurseForge 下載\" height=\"40\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcrystal-pvp-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 Modrinth 下載\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>環境調整</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>礦石外框</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>最佳化模型</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>更小的劍與工具</strong>，提升視野清晰度</li>\n<li><strong>緊湊的食物物品</strong>（金蘋果、胡蘿蔔及所有消耗品）</li>\n<li><strong>縮小手持方塊尺寸</strong></li>\n<li><strong>小型盾牌</strong></li>\n<li><strong>緊湊的藥水瓶</strong>，視野更清晰</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>減少視覺雜訊</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>無火焰覆蓋效果</strong></li>\n<li><strong>移除爆炸與流星錘打擊粒子效果</strong></li>\n<li><strong>無南瓜頭覆蓋效果</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>簡潔音效調整</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>禁用爆炸音效</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>物品比例調整</strong></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/dd196e3440a5ff260b5f16190bc44ba910125cf0.png\" width=\"45%\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/88efc06e804aac5df374e9ba1c70ed07852c5803.png\" width=\"45%\"></div>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>遊戲截圖</strong></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/c4d6a2459c50ac947f8d5e4c8b1a9a98c2968645.png\" width=\"100%\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/b551ca2b7b3e2a96bd0d111681aed06a7a432af4.png\" width=\"100%\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/ebab023cdc10ffd88d1ff3c7685c80588a7311ed.png\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>支援與反饋</strong></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252fPedX3xVaaxRXQRQj9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此提交反饋</a></div>",
